# Translation status

A string counts as translated once it differs from English. Strings made only of the words in
[kept_words.yml](<%= blob_url %>/status/kept_words.yml), placeholders and codes count as translated as they are,
and so do the keys a locale lists in `lib/trmnl/i18n/status/kept_keys/<locale>.yml`.

<%- areas = report.values.first.keys -%>
| Locale | Translated | Left | <%= areas.join(" | ") %> |
|---|---|--:|<%= "--:|" * areas.size %>
<%- progress.sort_by { |locale, total| [total.left, locale] }.each do |locale, total| -%>
| [`<%= locale %>`](<%= locale %>/README.md) | <%= total.bar %> <%= total.label %> | <%= total.left %> | <%= report[locale].values.map { |entries| TRMNL::I18n::Status::Progress.for(entries).label }.join(" | ") %> |
<%- end -%>
